{
  "$comment": [
    "The tree-sitter grammars of the editor module's mixed highlighter build (DEVTAB_VARIANT=highlighter:treeSitter) and where each comes from: compiled into the module (builtIn), a separate grammar file of the extension's package loaded when a text in that language is shown (file), or none (plain text).",
    "This table is the one place: crates/review-wasm/build.sh turns builtIn into gpui-kit features and builds every file grammar (build-grammars.sh), the generated grammars/index.json that the editor page reads comes from it, and the tests and the e2e read it. Moving a language between builtIn and file is the `grammar` field and a rebuild.",
    "Fields: id — the highlighter name (gpui-kit's Language::name, the id of extension/src/compare/languages.ts); crate and version — the grammar crate as Cargo.lock has it (the build refuses another version); feature — gpui-kit's feature for builtIn; parser — the directory of parser.c in the crate; symbol — the function that returns the language; highlights, injections, locals — the queries, kit:<path> under gpui-kit's src/highlighter/languages/ or crate:<path> in the grammar crate, as gpui-kit's languages.rs takes them; injects — gpui-kit's injection languages; aliases — other names that mean this language (file extensions, language ids from elsewhere); note — why a value differs from gpui-kit."
  ],
  "runtime": { "crate": "tree-sitter", "version": "0.27.2" },
  "languages": [
    { "id": "typescript", "grammar": "builtIn", "crate": "tree-sitter-typescript", "version": "0.23.2", "feature": "tree-sitter-typescript", "parser": "typescript/src", "symbol": "tree_sitter_typescript", "highlights": "kit:typescript/highlights.scm", "injections": "kit:javascript/injections.scm", "locals": "crate:queries/locals.scm", "injects": ["jsdoc", "json", "css", "html", "typescript", "javascript", "tsx", "yaml"], "aliases": ["ts", "mts", "cts"] },
    { "id": "tsx", "grammar": "builtIn", "crate": "tree-sitter-typescript", "version": "0.23.2", "feature": "tree-sitter-tsx", "parser": "tsx/src", "symbol": "tree_sitter_tsx", "highlights": "crate:queries/highlights.scm", "locals": "crate:queries/locals.scm", "injects": [], "aliases": ["jsx", "typescriptreact", "javascriptreact"] },
    { "id": "javascript", "grammar": "builtIn", "crate": "tree-sitter-javascript", "version": "0.23.1", "feature": "tree-sitter-javascript", "parser": "src", "symbol": "tree_sitter_javascript", "highlights": "kit:javascript/highlights.scm", "injections": "kit:javascript/injections.scm", "locals": "crate:queries/locals.scm", "injects": ["jsdoc", "json", "css", "html", "typescript", "javascript", "tsx", "yaml"], "aliases": ["js", "mjs", "cjs"] },
